,{"kind":"value","op":"set","namespace":"pi.result","key":"01a0d8ee-2aa4-775f-80d6-4ec320ba74dc","value":{"operationId":"01a0d8ee-2aa4-775f-80d6-4ec320ba74dc","kind":"run","status":"completed","fromTipId":"01a0d8eb-f38c-775f-80d6-4ebeaa98d57a","tipId":"01a0d8f0-8bea-775f-80d6-4eddbc0e550a","startedAt":1790345882276,"endedAt":1790346052372}},{"kind":"value","op":"set","namespace":"pi.result","key":"01a0d8f7-cd15-775f-80d6-4ee1f9442660","value":{"operationId":"01a0d8f7-cd15-775f-80d6-4ee1f9442660","kind":"run","status":"completed","fromTipId":"01a0d8f0-8bea-775f-80d6-4eddbc0e550a","tipId":"01a0d8f8-cbf1-775f-80d6-4efeb1f5e778","startedAt":1790346513685,"endedAt":1790346586651}},{"kind":"value","op":"set","namespace":"eta.tasks.state","key":"","value":[{"id":"t20","content":"A1 崩溃恢复语义纠偏：改回\"replay 到最后一条完整 entry、半截 turn 丢弃、完好 turn 保留\"；删掉我发明的 run.started/boundary 丢弃整 run 的规则；REFACTOR.md §K5 我加的那节改为对齐 §4.2 原文的提案。验收：kill-restart 测试证明完好的已提交 turn 保留、半截 turn 丢弃。","status":"completed","priority":"high","dependsOn":[],"blocks":[]},{"id":"t21","content":"A2 StorageService 接口重定为 eta-agent Storage 语义的内核版：commit(entries/values/usage 原子写批)、getEntries、getValue/setValue/listValues(prefix)、scanBranch、scanUsage、getStats(SessionStats)、compactJournal、repairTornTail、flush、close。源语义：eta-agent harness/session/types.ts + file-storage.ts。REFACTOR.md §4.1 的简化形状作废，重写为提案给你过目。验收：contract suite + jsonl 实现重写通过。","status":"completed","priority":"high","dependsOn":[],"blocks":[]},{"id":"t22","content":"A3 事件词汇对齐 eta-agent events.ts：ETA_EVENT_CATEGORIES（lifecycle/turn/usage/prompt/compaction/loop/goal/memory/skill/task/state/tool/retry/ask_user/btw）+ EtaEventData/EtaEventPayload 纯数据快照形状；kernel 只用子集但词汇表对齐。验收：快照测试 + 各处真实 emit 点核对。","status":"completed","priority":"high","dependsOn":[],"blocks":[]},{"id":"t23","content":"B1 KernelConfig：搬 lane Config（model identity/thinkingLevel/activeToolNames/compaction settings/retryPolicy/steeringMode/followUpMode/toolExecution/streamOptions）+ validateRetryPolicy/validateCompactionSettings/validateToolNames 三件套。源：harness/config.ts + runtime/types.ts。验收：非法配置抛对应错误类型的测试。","status":"completed","priority":"high","dependsOn":[],"blocks":[]},{"id":"t24","content":"B2 流式 generation：搬 execution/assistant.ts 的 AssistantStreamObserver/streamHarnessAssistant 语义——stream frames（text/thinking/toolcall delta）实时进 bus；usage 每帧累计；OutputRate（output-rate.ts tokens/sec，含 dip 修正）移植；runner 从 request/response 改为 stream 驱动。验收：fake stream provider 端到端，断言 delta 事件序列 + usage 累计 + tokens/sec。","status":"completed","priority":"high","dependsOn":[],"blocks":[]},{"id":"t25","content":"B3 retry：搬 internal/retry-compat.ts（AgentRetryPolicy maxRetries/baseDelayMs/maxAgentDelayMs、retryDelayMs 指数退避封顶 60s）+ drive/retry.ts waitUntil（abortable）；不可重试错误（auth/config/model_unavailable）直接失败不重试。验收：fake provider 模拟可重试/不可重试/中途恢复，断言退避序列与 abort 打断。","status":"completed","priority":"high","dependsOn":[],"blocks":[]},{"id":"t26","content":"B4 overflow recovery：generation 报 context overflow → 触发一次 compaction → 重试（overflowRecoveryUsed 单次标志，op.state 里有）；compaction 失败或再次 overflow 才算失败。源：drive/structural.ts 中 compaction 路径 + lane.compactForWindow。验收：fake provider 先 overflow 后成功，断言 compaction 被调一次且只一次。","status":"completed","priority":"high","dependsOn":[],"blocks":[]},{"id":"t27","content":"B5 队列语义：steer/followUp/nextRun 三种 + QueueMode all/one-at-a-time + planBoundaryInbox 的 boundary 消费规则（boundary 先吃 steer；无 trigger 时吃 followUp）+ cancelQueued + InvalidMessage 校验（empty/pending_assistant/images_with_non_user）。源：lane.enqueue + drive/boundary.ts。验收：各 mode × 各 kind 矩阵测试。","status":"in_progress","priority":"high","dependsOn":[],"blocks":[]},{"id":"t28","content":"B6 toolExecution parallel/sequential：lane 的 toolExecution 配置 + 并行执行语义 + file-mutation-queue（同一文件的写/编辑串行化）语义移植。源：drive/tools.ts + tools/file-mutation-queue.ts。验收：并行时序断言 + 同文件两次编辑串行断言。","status":"pending","priority":"high","dependsOn":[],"blocks":[]},{"id":"t29","content":"B7 abort：AbortSignal 贯穿 generation（stream 消费中断）、tool execution（effect-gate AbortRequested）、boundary 等待（waitUntil reject）；abort 后 journal 语义与 A1 恢复规则一致。源：execution/effect-gate.ts + context.ts。验收：各层 abort 测试。","status":"pending","priority":"high","dependsOn":[],"blocks":[]},{"id":"t30","content":"B8 usage 记账：搬 session/types.ts UsageRow（per assistant entry）+ lane.recordUsage + SessionStats(messageCount+usage) + compaction/economics.ts cost 汇总；UsageRow 进 journal（A2 接口的 usage 写）。验收：run 结束后 getStats 聚合正确、usage 行落 journal、重放后 stats 重建一致。","status":"pending","priority":"high","dependsOn":[],"blocks":[]},{"id":"t31","content":"B9 compaction seam + 纯函数：§3 裁决的 readContext()/replaceContext(summary) 两方法；搬 compaction/compaction.ts 的 shouldCompact（含 window-independent 绝对上限 64k，memory #40/#50）、estimateContextTokens、findCutPoint/findTurnStartIndex、fitCompactionSettings；CompactionService 接口，默认实现留给内置插件。验收：纯函数移植测试 + seam 调用时序测试。","status":"completed","priority":"high","dependsOn":[],"blocks":[]},{"id":"t32","content":"B10 Runner.requestState()：搬 LaneRequestState 语义——现读 model/thinkingLevel/tools(+missingToolNames)/systemPrompt/streamOptions/retryPolicy 的快照，btw/侧请求用。验收：run 中改配置后快照反映新值的测试。","status":"pending","priority":"medium","dependsOn":[],"blocks":[]},{"id":"t33","content":"B11 解析链：systemPrompt（string | (toolContext)=>string 形态）、toolContext（值或 resolver）、toProviderMessages（entry→provider message 投影钩子）、entryProjectors。源：drive/generation.ts prepareGeneration + runtime/types.ts Config。验收：三种形态各自解析正确 + 投影钩子被调用的测试。","status":"pending","priority":"medium","dependsOn":[],"blocks":[]},{"id":"t34","content":"C1 Entry union 保真：补齐 CompactionEntry/BranchSummaryEntry 的 details?: JsonValue + fromHook: boolean；MergeEntry details?；EntryBase customType? 的处理按 §6 裁决（plugin 显式扩 union，不搬 custom 后门——但我会在 REFACTOR.md 写明裁决理由）；MessageEntry 恢复 terminate?: true 字段（eta-agent 有）。源：session/types.ts。验收：类型快照 + 投影测试。","status":"pending","priority":"medium","dependsOn":[],"blocks":[]},{"id":"t35","content":"C2 旧 journal 读取：写 eta-agent {w:[...],t} 格式的 reader/importer，能 replay 出 entries/usage/values 到新 storage；读你现有 session 文件（含本 session）验证。源：session/file-storage.ts 的 replay 路径。验收：对 eta-agent 真实 session 文件的导入测试。","status":"pending","priority":"medium","dependsOn":[],"blocks":[]},{"id":"t36","content":"D1-D3 原语保真复查：goal.ts（anti-spin/gate/continuations/lastMessageShowsIntent/applyGoalEntries 逐行对照补测）、task-store.ts（依赖环/id 不复用/restore 守卫/renderTasks 对照）、persona.ts（renderPersonaBlock 内容/缺失降级 warn 对照）。验收：每个语义点有对照测试。","status":"pending","priority":"medium","dependsOn":[],"blocks":[]},{"id":"t37","content":"E1 端到端：fake stream provider 全链路跑 kernel（stream 事件/usage/retry/overflow/queue/abort/goal 续杯/persona 注入/落盘/重放），一次跑通证明 kernel 能驱动真实 agent 工作流。验收：一个综合测试文件，全绿。","status":"pending","priority":"medium","dependsOn":[],"blocks":[]}]},{"kind":"value","op":"set","namespace":"pi.result","key":"01a0d8fb-81d5-775f-80d6-4f0256347e41","value":{"operationId":"01a0d8fb-81d5-775f-80d6-4f0256347e41","kind":"run","status":"completed","fromTipId":"01a0d8f8-cbf1-775f-80d6-4efeb1f5e778","tipId":"01a0d8fd-9be1-775f-80d6-4f646d7f87ab","startedAt":1790346756565,"endedAt":1790346908468}},{"kind":"value","op":"set","namespace":"pi.result","key":"01a0d8fe-7935-775f-80d6-4f68d2b597be","value":{"operationId":"01a0d8fe-7935-775f-80d6-4f68d2b597be","kind":"run","status":"completed","fromTipId":"01a0d8fd-9be1-775f-80d6-4f646d7f87ab","tipId":"01a0d8fe-7938-775f-80d6-4f6ffbe7c89b","startedAt":1790346950965,"endedAt":1790346975764}},{"kind":"value","op":"set","namespace":"pi.result","key":"01a0d900-34b8-775f-80d6-4f745dd15221","value":{"operationId":"01a0d900-34b8-775f-80d6-4f745dd15221","kind":"run","status":"failed","error":{"code":"assistant_error","message":"403: {\"message\":\"You've reached your 5-hour usage limit. Your quota will reset when the current 5-hour window ends. To continue now, purchase extra usage or upgrade your plan: https://www.kimi.com/membership/subscription?tab=quota\",\"type\":\"access_terminated_error\"}"},"fromTipId":"01a0d900-34b8-775f-80d6-4f7351652b10","ti